{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act13side_level_act13side_05_end",
  "groupId": "act13side",
  "stageId": "act13side_05",
  "title": "人言可畏",
  "storyCode": "NL-5",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "274cf0d1c5f660462c0a2ffd667c95e572dc536c4f1ad0eb58d8fe0848137f50",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔2 5-2"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G05"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......之前我還奇怪，為什麼你們要帶著那個路都走不了的薩卡茲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃......莫妮克閣下，我怎麼什麼都沒感覺到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那就少說話，少丟臉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......無胄盟嗎，有何貴幹？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "首先，請允許我向耀騎士道歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "關於今天無胄盟綁架了瑪莉婭一事——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——喔，別衝動，再說也不是我幹的啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你們......卑劣的劊子手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑪莉婭此時應該已經安全回家了，放心，沒有後續針對你們的行動，就算有，也會儘量做得......不那麼完美。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無胄盟也只是收錢辦事，就算我們不想，畢竟上面的人也盯著，你說對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你們在襲擊感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這也是上面的安排，別怪我們啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "惡行不因為其緣由而洗刷罪孽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......說的也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，我們今天這不是來打聲招呼嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們沒什麼好聊的，要動手的話，隨時奉陪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是咄咄逼人，直說了吧，我們想擺脫商業聯合會的控制。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天來，我就是想把這話挑明的。我們是對立的立場，畢竟現在我們還是聯合會的人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我們是否可以私下簽訂一份和平協議呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "耀騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你，耀騎士，臨光家族和那些附庸，以及“羅德島”。我們希望你們不要影響到我們的計畫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "相對的，無胄盟不會妨礙你的奪冠，更不會對和耀騎士相關的人物出手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那些感染者呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......遺憾，我們也不能做到所有事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感染者對我們而言也算是個威脅，但是請放心，現在的我們也需要那些感染者騎士——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當你們的替罪者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不是我索求的東西，無胄盟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——無胄盟是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "古時候，為了對抗荒淫無道的騎士貴族，當地的農民和扈從們串通，雇傭了一批身經百戰的殺手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是他們——全都失手了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "騎士把叛徒通通吊死，懸掛在城堡之上，以儆效尤。領地內的村民怒不敢言，只能忍氣吞聲，放棄抵抗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過後來，有一位弓手主動請纓，當時人們普遍認為弓箭手無法應對庫蘭塔騎士的速度，並不抱期望......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然而翌日清晨，那位暴虐騎士的家人們醒來後，卻看見那位騎士保持著衝鋒的姿勢，仰面朝天，被一杆長槍釘在了廣場地面——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等到人們靠近細看，才發現那並不是一杆長槍，而是一支利箭，由玄鐵鑄造而成的利箭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“玄鐵”，是歷史上第一位無胄盟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然我對於我們只是被雇來的殺手這點還是有自覺的，不過呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有些傳說，可不是空穴來風。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——臨光！上面！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "耀騎士抬起頭。\n路燈暗淡，今夜星光璀璨。\n而其中一顆流星，閃爍了數下之後，偏離了群星的軌道。\n直墜大地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——箭！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斬斷它！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G05"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咿呀——！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "麗茲，小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（臨光和我同時出劍......竟然，都沒能砍斷？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沒事吧，二位？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒、沒事......剛、剛才那是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "瑪嘉烈沉默地望向一旁。\n漆黑的箭矢，如長矛般的箭矢，沒入水泥地面之中，悄無聲息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "了不起......能反應過來還擋開玄鐵一箭的人，我還是頭一次見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "耀騎士的劍術果然了得，那邊那位赦罪師，也讓人看到了一些別開生面的技巧......幸好箭矢是沒有生命的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——那是靈魂的味道嗎？薩卡茲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這個醫師的劍術和法術......究竟到了什麼地步？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少說廢話......這就是你們所謂的，停戰協議嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們心裡清楚，這一箭並非衝著取你們的性命去的。否則，那邊那位坐著的薩卡茲......已經死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "招呼就到此為止，各位，請認真考慮一下我們的提議。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......還有，希望剛才那箭能讓你們明白，無胄盟並非在向你們求饒——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“玄鐵”有三位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們能擋下幾箭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慢著！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "兩位無胄盟的身影溶解在了霓虹與月光的間隙中。\n耳邊只剩下爵士樂的聲響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......“玄鐵”，有著黑曜石般光澤的金屬，很重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就如其名......像是從......天上落下的一般。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜鶯",
      "speakerId": "char_179_cgbird",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天......上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......天上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "耀騎士再次看向天空。\n群星在此刻彷彿殺機四伏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這支箭......從很遠的地方射出，極高的抛物線讓它變得彷彿從天而降。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不合常理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......無胄盟，“玄鐵”大位，如那個油嘴滑舌的男人所說，他們才是“無胄盟”一詞的原典。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪嘉烈",
      "speakerId": "avg_1014_nearl2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣的殺手，此刻，也許正盯著我們的項上人頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們確實得警惕一些。這裡是卡西米爾......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "閃靈",
      "speakerId": "char_147_shining",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是他們罪行的堡壘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G03"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......馬克維茨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了嗎？麥基先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......總覺得你這兩天變得輕快了許多，發生什麼了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......只是找到了自己該做的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該做的事情嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽說，你和羅德島製藥的關係十分密切，前些日子，還安排了他們的領導人與其他幾家企業的會晤？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是這樣沒錯......怎麼了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也知道，感染者的輿論壓力越來越大，我們總要做出一些反應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "羅德島是零號地塊為數不多的境外企業，但也是得到監正會大力支持的企業。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們需要認真對待羅德島。實際上，今天幾位常務董事已經明示，要我們調查......並處理羅德島。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "處......理嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "零號地塊有一些秘密，是不能讓外人知道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這件事直接動用了無胄盟，“白金”大位的指揮權也會再次讓渡給此事的負責人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......連無胄盟都......！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過......我向董事會提議，把這件事的負責人變更成了你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！麥基先生！感謝您！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是希望你和羅德島的私交，能讓這件事變得簡單一些。在卡西米爾做生意，總得按卡西米爾的規矩來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......還有一件事。這件事請絕對不要聲張，否則會很危險。雖然目前白金及大部分無胄盟還在管控之內。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人麥基",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_212_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但無胄盟內部出了問題，大問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "發言人馬克維茨",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_211_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G09"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您又在發呆了嗎？感到無聊嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最近的大騎士領，有很多人開始抵制感染者騎士......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果不是這樣的話，嘻......我倒是願意陪您稍微逛一逛呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "比起我，阿米婭她們承受著更大的壓力。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是這樣......當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我時常在想，你們這些人，來卡西米爾的目的......究竟是什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "可露希爾總是抱怨財政赤字，總得想想辦法。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "臨光也說，卡西米爾還有等待被拯救的人們。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我問過她，她打算怎麼做。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "得到答案之後，我決定支持她。阿米婭也是。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "所以我們來了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不算太意外的答案呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然在過去，我只會覺得這是冠冕堂皇的藉口......耀騎士在羅德島的地位很高嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我還真沒考慮過“地位”這個問題。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "礫",
              "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "......聽說現代的卡西米爾企業也流行鼓吹扁平化管理，但其實只是讓底層勞動者放鬆警惕的由頭。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "礫",
              "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "不過，如果博士您這麼說......我就當是吧。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "礫",
              "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "這是不是意味著，如果我也去羅德島兼職的話，能和您......平起平坐呢？"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "我很尊敬臨光小姐，與地位無關。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "礫",
              "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "欸，真讓人羡慕。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "礫",
              "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "您是排除了身份與地位，單純將耀騎士作為一個“人”來看待......還尊敬著她嗎？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "礫",
              "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "羅德島的其他人......會得到您這樣的尊敬嗎？如果會的話，我倒是有些好奇呢。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "瑪嘉烈·臨光是我們的幹員，我並沒有把她當做耀騎士。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "礫",
              "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "有很多騎士都尊敬著耀騎士。不過，原因無非兩種。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "礫",
              "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "要嘛因為，她是“臨光”，要嘛因為，她是“耀騎士”。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "礫",
              "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "能聽到別的答案，對一個卡西米爾的騎士而言，可真是一件新鮮事。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......博士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是被販賣到卡西米爾來的，從那時候起，我就被老爺教育，要時刻準備好為他人獻身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕此刻，我也會為了您而死哦？嘻嘻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "因為我是你的護衛目標？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "因為監正院的命令？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......所謂的征戰騎士，就是這麼被訓練的啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，耀騎士的行為，在我看來，有些渺茫，有些遙遠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您覺得，為他人的理想獻身，是一件偉大的事情嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "當然。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "是的。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那如果這個人的理想也是為了他人獻身，最後，我們又得到了什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "得到了一片更加美好的大地。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "哪怕只美好了一丁點。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天真的想法，這可和您在商業聯合會面前機敏的表現大不相符......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "對了，礫小姐。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您請說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "如果你覺得我不值得你犧牲，就別這麼做。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......怎麼可以說這種話，您在質疑我的忠——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "如果你覺得我值得你犧牲，那就為了我們活下去。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "礫",
      "speakerId": "avg_237_gravel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "您只是一名優秀的騎士，羅德島的合夥人。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "您是自由的。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G07"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在想什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，只是......很久沒見過玄鐵出手了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上一次是什麼時候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你還沒升到青金這個位置......處決上一任白金的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那時候的白金大位是欣特萊雅的師父......差不多這個意思吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那天下著雨，下午四點四十七，本來，我正打算出差去一趟別的城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那時候的青金只有我一個人，我突然接到電話，說是“白金”叛逃了，要立刻去處理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......然後呢，你親手殺死了你的同事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。如果真那樣的話，恐怕我晚上做夢會覺得不安的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實等我們匆匆趕到現場的時候......哈哈。那是一棟爛尾樓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整個三樓面目全非，叛徒......被高高地釘在一堵牆上，胸口插著一支玄鐵重箭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從我不太專業的現場勘探技巧來判斷......“白金”曾試圖逃離那裡，卻在半空中被那支重箭橫穿胸口，釘入了牆壁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我當時就在那堵牆的下面。那個愛上目標而試圖背叛我們的可憐人，就那麼被釘在上面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就記得，那堵牆很白。他的死狀就像是受難者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有見識太少的傻子才會被嚷嚷著自由與理想的傢伙騙到。他們根本不理解生存的本質是什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......他們終於打算行動了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫妮克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_208_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......紅松騎士團嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，他們非常謹慎，不過現在......他們終於按捺不住了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟這兩天連抵制感染者的遊行都出現了呢......真滑稽啊，我都搞不清誰才是受害者了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，怎麼又是電話，真麻煩啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼沒有按照座標移動？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "否則，赦罪師和耀騎士沒有機會攔下那一箭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你讓他們面朝北方，提前看見了我的箭矢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "否則，至少，那個坐在椅子上的薩卡茲必死無疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊哈哈，不知道您在說什麼——就算打哈哈也沒用吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是我臨時的判斷，老闆，對於耀騎士這種不撞南牆不回頭的人來說，殺掉一個，只會激化她的行為。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "若能讓耀騎士失去理智，也未嘗不可。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這太危險了，老闆。原諒我先斬後奏，但我覺得，現在的威脅恰到好處，過猶不及。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅伊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "相信我，耀騎士不會妨礙您的計畫......說起來，我能問問現在事情怎麼樣了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......董事會很快就會察覺到。但是沒關係，等到感染者們讓這座城市癱瘓的時候......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會親自解決最後幾個接線人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "電話那頭的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_209_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從今往後，將不再有人，知曉無胄盟高層的真面目。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G05"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "查絲汀娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_430_fartth_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......就位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_kxstreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑟奇亞克",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103nc_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽得見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G07"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "準備就緒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_221",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦！我們能做到的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......索娜。恢復備用電源的速度很快，我們不知道他們是不是有改進過的應急措施。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格蕾納蒂",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_123",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "千萬......千萬不要掉以輕心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G05"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，那我是要繼續鬧點大動靜了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_220",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走啊，野鬃，把那些無胄盟的腦袋都打爛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾沃娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_496_wdmane_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，隨時可以出發。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G04"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......艾沃娜會正面襲擊無胄盟的巡邏小隊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "半小時後，小灰突襲能源區。不出意外的話，監正會的守衛應該會被“撤走”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會潛入聯合會大樓，拿走我們需要的，輕輕鬆鬆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那麼，開始行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我可以幫你混進大樓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在這之後，我就幫不上你了，而且也要有人確保道路通暢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "索娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_122",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已經夠了，謝啦，托蘭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別忘了我對你說的，你們在做的事情，有著超乎你們自己想像的意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "托蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_213_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓所有人都見證一下吧，見證一座城市的慟哭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
